{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のもうちょっとしたら、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"19:00〜20:54 フジテレビ系「世界の何だコレ!?ミステリーSP」生駒里奈"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"出演しますよ〜(＾ω＾)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/03/02/1239785/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"KERAでずっと見ていたこんな風に個性を可愛く出来るってすごいな〜って憧れてみていた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きゃりーぱみゅぱみゅさんと"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/03/02/1239785/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まさか、テレビで共演出来るとはっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"緊張しすぎてあまりしゃべれなかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/03/02/1239785/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"が、こんな風に憧れている人と共演出来るのはほんとに奇跡っ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆様是非見てくださいねっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"出川さんともお久しぶりに会えて嬉しかったなぁヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お久しぶりですと言えるのって、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんとにすごい事だよね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"感謝を忘れずに、夢に向かってもっともっとバラエティ頑張るぞっヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/03/02/1239785/0003.jpeg","alt":""